<title>SWITZERLAND: Berner Insurance boosts 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Berner Insurance boosts 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Swiss francs)</p>
<p> Net profit			    15.9	vs   14.0</p>
<p> Gross premiums		     610.4	vs  604.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Other members of the Berner group also posted profit gains. Berner Life profit rose to 2.2 million from 2.0 million on gross premiums of 545.3 million, up from 450.1 million. The Alba unit's profit rose to 2.6 million from 2.5 million as premiums increased to 91.1 million from 90.9 million. Allianz has a stake of nearly 50 percent in the group.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
